title: The Restoration of Order Act
subtitle: The New Order moves to undo the Rim's rights.
tags: event
view-if: pal_wing = "new_order" and parties_has_pal and pal_chancellor and (rim_enfranchised or sentience_rights) and not repeal_tried and not finale and not game_ending
max-visits: 1
priority: 3
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_chancellery.svg

= The Restoration of Order Act

With the Chancellor's blessing, Janus Greejatus introduces the Restoration of Order Act. In the name of security, it would [? if rim_enfranchised : strip the Rim of its new seats in the Senate?][? if rim_enfranchised and sentience_rights : , and ?][? if sentience_rights : repeal the Rights of Sentience?]. The galleries are full of grey tunics.

- @fight: Rally the Senate against it.
- @vote_no: Vote against it.

@fight
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 political capital.
subtitle: −1 political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; SW.repealVote(Q, true); !}
go-to: repeal_result

@vote_no
subtitle: The Caucus votes no and hopes it is enough.
on-arrival: {! SW.repealVote(Q, false); !}
go-to: repeal_result

@repeal_result

[+ vote_html +]

[? if repealed : The Act passes. On the Rim, crowds gather outside the Republic's offices, and the Separatists' broadcasts have a new story to tell. ?][? if not repealed : The Act fails. Greejatus walks out of the chamber without a word, and the galleries empty after him. ?]
